WEBVTT

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:24.620
Hasekura-kun?!

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:40.270
What was I...

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:45.650
Blood... I want blood...

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:59.610
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:59.610
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:02.820
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibiku wa

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:02.820
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:07.080
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:07.080
I want to tell you, but I can't.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:11.080
Hatenai omoi ha anata...

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:11.080
I always long for you...

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:21.510
Boukansha no hibi ni yuuki wo dashitara sayonara

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:21.510
Say goodbye to the days of just being a bystander.

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:30.560
Demo "jiyuu" no teigi ni buranko no you ni yureteru no ne?

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:30.560
But am I swaying over the meaning of "Freedom", like a swing?

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:35.690
Gosenfu ni kaita kaidan

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:35.690
Stairs drawn on a music score,

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:39.190
Ippo susunde niho sagattemo

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:39.190
Even if I go down one step and back two steps,

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:43.200
Honno chotto setsunasa utau

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:43.200
The notes play a sad melody.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.240
Watashi no real kanjite ne

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.240
Hear my reality!

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:50.160
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:50.160
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:53.710
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibikuwa

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:53.710
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:57.670
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:57.670
I want to tell you, but can't

00:01:57.670 --> 00:02:01.090
Zutto anata wo sagashiteta

00:01:57.670 --> 00:02:01.090
I've always been searching for you.

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:05.180
Tatoeba sou anataga hikari

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:05.180
Let's say you are the light

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.640
Watashi ga kagede mitsume aetanara

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.640
And I'm the shadow, gazing at one other.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.680
Namida iro no diamond

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.680
The tear-colored diamond

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:16.480
Nee zero kara kagayakasetai

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:16.480
I want to make it shine from nothing.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:22.030
Kowagaranaide musunde ne ai wo

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:22.030
Don't be afraid of falling in love.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:24.200
Deaiwo...

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:24.200
Nor of meeting people...

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:33.460
Memory

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:30.910
Good bye.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:54.980
What happened?!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.410
A vampire?

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.670
Yeah! Last night! At the chapel!

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.210
A girl from Class 4 saw it!

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:22.710
Ah, I know. The thing everyone's talking about these days.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:24.300
It's only a rumor.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.170
Vampires? That's too dramatic.

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:30.180
But she almost was attacked and had her blood sucked.

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.050
No way!

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:37.020
She said it flew to the sky and ran off when Sister came out.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:41.360
It was covered in a black cloak and flew through the night.

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:44.900
That fits perfectly with a vampire!

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:47.110
But they can't exist.

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:51.740
If you let your guard down like that, you might get bitten from behind.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.200
Everyone's talking about the vampire.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.080
If something like that existed, I'd love to see-

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:01.630
Oh, my god!!!

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:07.720
The rumor is trivial, but it's true the students are concerned.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.800
Play along with me a little, Sei.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:12.510
Only I could pull off that vampire joke.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.930
Prez. Could the one who was spotted be...

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.560
I'm not foolish enough to be seen like that.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:20.640
Maybe it was Erika.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:21.480
Wha-

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:23.190
O-Of course not!

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:27.530
Is something wrong, Erika-senpai?

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.740
In any case, I have nothing to do with it.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.660
Keep those crazy comments to yourself.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:37.790
So if it's not either of you,
are there other vampires on this island?

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.830
Technically, there are.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:45.920
But then again, there aren't.

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:47.920
What's that supposed to mean?

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:54.800
Either way, with the rumor so widespread, we must uncover the truth behind it.

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.010
Yes, sir!

00:04:56.470 --> 00:05:00.480
So let's start patrols tonight.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:01.980
Patrols?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.690
Starting tonight?

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.360
You stay in your room.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.980
Yes, Nii-sama.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:23.750
What would you do if it really appeared?

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:25.630
Run right away, duh.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.170
You won't protect me?

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.960
They're vampires for crying out loud.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:32.880
Gee, thanks. Let's go home already. It's going to get dark soon.

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:38.010
Being talked about like this actually makes me pretty restless.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:39.720
Vice Prez.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:44.350
You're still naive, Erika, to feel stress over something like this.

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:46.900
It's strange that you're not.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:48.770
Uncovering the truth will put an end to it.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:55.910
That's a fact, so you should always be prepared for it.

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:00.870
I am prepared.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.330
Only...

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:10.050
You can't, Onee-chan!

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:12.170
Don't try to stop me, Hina-chan!

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:16.220
It's the RA's duty to protect everyone's night!

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:17.430
Let's go, Heiji!

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:18.800
Why me?

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:21.390
Kanade-san, what is this about?

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:23.480
Kouhei-kun.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:28.270
Would you stop her, too? She's saying she's going on a patrol.

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:30.020
Patrol? Kanade-san?

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:35.740
If vampires do anything to Hina-chan, I will never forgive them!

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:39.200
Gosh, Onee-chan! It's dangerous, so stop it!

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:42.080
They're vampires. They're scary.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.580
It'll be fine.

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.790
Can you try stopping her, too, Sendo-san?

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:53.840
Don't worry. Even if a real one does appear, see?

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:56.840
I've got an almighty cross,
so there's nothing to be scared about!

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.930
And see the garlic?

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:01.850
I bought them from the farmer's market, so they're extra strong!

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:06.400
I will expel those that disturb the school's peace with the smell!

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:12.940
I see, looks like you're well-prepared.

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:15.570
In that case, you have to equip them correctly, too.

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:22.580
Hang in there, elder Yuki.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:25.040
If you're like that, you'll never beat vampires.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.710
This is a weapon of last resort.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.130
What ruckus are you making?!

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:36.340
Maru-chan!

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:39.470
Yuki-san? Why are you dressed like that?

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:44.140
You're supposed to be a role model for the students, so why are you making a scene here?

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:45.430
But...

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:48.140
Vampires only exist in fiction.

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:49.560
They're nothing more than figments of people's imaginations!

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.400
"Imaginations," she says.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:59.410
But, it's true we've had a stranger roaming about the school recently.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:03.490
Until the case is solved, you are not to go out at night.

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:05.120
Do you all understand?!

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:09.120
Unfortunately, we can't do that.

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:11.290
Sendo-kun, did you say something?

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.420
No, nothing.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.960
Okay, that's all for now.

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:19.220
As Shizuko-chan says, everyone, return to your rooms.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:20.930
Shizu...

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:23.800
I told you to stop calling me that!

00:08:25.140 --> 00:08:26.600
You don't have to blush like that.

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:27.730
I am not!

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:28.890
I know you are.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:29.600
Let's go, Onee-chan.

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:30.480
I'm not!

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:31.900
Oh, fine.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:33.440
See you, Kouhei-kun.

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:34.730
Yeah.

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:37.440
Don't get so angry.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:38.860
Whose fault is it?

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.950
So what good was I?

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:44.660
Don't make me repeat myself so many times!

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:48.000
You should be more aware of your position as Student Council President!

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:52.330
The Student Council's patrol...

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:53.960
Looks like it's on.

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:00.590
What do you expect; there's no one around.

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:03.260
It hurts; right here, in my heart.

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:07.770
It feels like I'm deceiving and betraying everyone.

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:16.480
I don't think so.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:21.740
Everyone has a secret or two they can't tell others.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:29.370
At the very least, there's no way you, who cares about the school most, are betraying everyone.

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:31.330
Hasekura-kun.

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:43.340
Vice Prez?

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:45.550
I-It's nothing.

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:46.680
Let's move on.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:47.890
Yeah.

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:59.690
There they are.

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:04.280
We took a look around, but we didn't see anyone suspicious.

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:06.620
So you guys, as well.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:10.080
Maybe it wasn't something we should have mobilized over.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:17.960
Erika.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:18.880
Yes.

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:29.680
Looks like the rumor didn't end as just a rumor.

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:31.350
It wasn't me...

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:32.730
Who are you?!

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:34.850
Show your face!

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:45.860
Who are you?!

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:03.800
No way...

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:05.550
You're...

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.910
Kuze-san... Why?

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.040
What is the meaning of this?

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:37.960
I thought she might show herself if I caused some commotion.

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:42.760
Pity. You are not my master.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:43.680
Master?

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.680
And she's not here, either.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.600
Kuze-san, are you...

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:54.770
Dependent.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.230
Hold it!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.950
Looks like we have much to ask her.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:07.740
Hasekura, we must go after them.

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:08.700
Yes!

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:42.900
Is someone there?

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.410
Onee-chan?

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:07.090
I'm totally out of shape!

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.140
It must have been my imagination.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.180
Oh no.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:56.390
Of all people, it's Yuki Haruna.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:09.360
Haruna-chan, are you all right?

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:10.870
Haruna-chan!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:14.240
Eri-chan?

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:22.750
Yuki-san?

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:23.710
Did you?

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.840
Hey, Vice Prez!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.180
Haruna!

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:40.440
I see. So she saw you.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.040
In the end, we let Kuze Kiriha escape.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.670
We need to deal with this right now.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:11.840
Ordinary students finding out about us is a matter of life and death.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:15.970
And of all people, Yuki Haruna is the one who saw you.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:19.680
You know what must be done, right, Erika?

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:24.230
You only have to do the same as you did before.

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.940
You're only closing the lid that cracked open.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:30.610
After all, vampires are vampires.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:35.990
It's the only way for us to live amongst humans.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.370
Do you understand, Erika?

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.470
Vice Prez.

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:12.740
No, you aren't...

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:16.200
Stop it! Haruna won't tell anyone!

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.830
She wouldn't go spreading the secret!

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:20.620
You know that, right?

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.460
Have faith in her!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:27.920
Haruna would accept you for what you are!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:31.380
This won't be the first time.

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:36.260
This won't be the first time I will be erasing her memories.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.810
It was six years ago.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.610
Let's go, Haruna-chan.

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:51.650
Yup, Eri-chan.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:55.780
Back then, I often played with Yuki-san.

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:56.700
But...

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.640
Haruna-chan, are you all right?

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:19.050
Haruna-chan!

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.990
I'm sorry, Haruna-chan.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:57.300
Having my true self seen, I took away her memories.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:02.350
The year's worth of memories that we were friends.

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:05.430
You erased her memories six years ago?

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:09.150
Even if we live far apart, we're still friends.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.730
I'll write letters to you.

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:13.730
You'll always be my friend.

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:14.070
I'm sorry...

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:14.280
Dear Kouhei-kun

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:19.740
Then... that is why Haruna doesn't remember me?

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:24.160
And I have to erase those memories again.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:29.920
From the earlier shock, she's about to remember the memories I took from her.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:32.670
What? Erasing her memories because she'll remember them?

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:35.170
What is that? Is that right?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:38.760
You told me before, Vice Prez!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:42.220
You said it hurt to have to erase my memories...

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:45.680
...and how there's a person who doesn't mind forgetting what happened at this school...

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:47.980
...and how that person was your friend!

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:53.650
But memories from six years ago are okay?

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.610
It doesn't hurt to do it to Haruna?

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:57.280
Isn't Haruna your friend, too?

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:02.740
Don't worry! Haruna will accept it all even if she finds out about everything.

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.240
Come on!

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:08.500
Please. Don't take Haruna's memories away.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.750
Stop... It scares me...

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.340
It scares me!

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.090
Vice Prez?

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.510
It's over when it becomes public.

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:32.520
We're such creatures!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:36.190
Stop.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.700
Stop it!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.670
Vice Prez...

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:00.840
Eri-chan?

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:05.510
Thank you.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:10.600
You saved me, right?

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.500
Haruna-chan.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.750
Eri-chan...

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.170
I'm sorry!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:38.710
Haruna!

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:45.550
Why?

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:47.140
Is this all right?

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:55.270
You're saying... You're saying this is how you're going to do things?

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:56.560
Kou-chan?

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.490
But why?

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:27.760
Haruna. You...

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:32.890
Yes. Yes. I can tell.

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:35.100
I can tell, Kouhei-kun.

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:38.560
All my memories are coming back.

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:39.860
Haruna.

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:44.650
This is the answer I wished for.

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:48.240
I don't want to deceive my friends anymore.

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.410
Yeah.

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.540
Eri-chan.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:54.790
Thank you!

00:21:57.710 --> 00:21:59.040
Haruna-chan.

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:26.400
I miss you

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:46.540
Mabushii kurai e ni kaita jikan nano

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:46.540
Just like in a perfect painting,

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:51.300
Sou ima ha...

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:51.300
Now is a dazzling moment.

00:22:55.590 --> 00:23:05.350
Kawari hajimeta machinami ni me wo sorashi

00:22:55.590 --> 00:23:05.350
I look away from the city that's starting to change

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:11.070
Omoide ha tada iuno

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:11.070
And my memories whisper to me, saying,

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:18.200
Soko de tomadou dake

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:18.200
You're only at a loss.

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:20.200
I miss you

00:23:20.200 --> 00:23:24.460
Omoi wo sono mama dakishimete

00:23:20.200 --> 00:23:24.460
Hold on to your feelings.

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:26.370
I miss you

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:30.710
Kawaranu omoi wo shiritai no

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:30.710
I want to know how you've always felt.

00:23:30.710 --> 00:23:32.590
I miss you

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.340
Negatteru kara

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.340
I'll always long for you, so...

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:42.350
I miss you...

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:52.860
Kaya-sama.

00:23:52.860 --> 00:23:55.450
There is something I must report.

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:20.020
Ninth Episode

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:20.020
「Servant」

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:09.590
I was walking a path without end.

00:24:10.470 --> 00:24:11.930
It was not painful.

00:24:11.930 --> 00:24:13.550
It was not sad.

00:24:13.550 --> 00:24:15.510
It was not fun at all.

00:24:16.220 --> 00:24:18.930
After all, the beginning is where I end up.
